{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52148","headline":"四言奉陪皇太子释奠诗一首应令 四 · 许敬宗","name":"四言奉陪皇太子释奠诗一首应令 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"前星降彩，猗兰挺秀。\n少海扬清，若华腾茂。\n仙簧妙响，长琴雅奏。\n具体生知，尅昌宸[构]。\n（其四）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许敬宗","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52148.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52148","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}